From 5ebcbbba725de847fba17220f292364b0b1c981a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 11:09:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Activate scoped native annotation runtime at serve
 startup

Wire the existing seven-family captured annotation composition outside sessions
startup, retaining links ownership and the explicit OFF/unsupported legacy path.
ON suppresses both legacy starters; readiness precedes cutover. Retain runtime
custody through failed cleanup and refuse a replacement until custody is cleared.

Proof:
- Historical pre-edit baseline: 59 files / 663 passes (archived per-file XML).
- Fresh-main canonical regression run: 78 files / 836 passes, zero failures.
- Real native prepare and real annotation+sessions app entry both pass.
- Startup RED: missing lifecycle / default activation produced 2 failures.
- Five independent startup mutants fail: default OFF, platform gate removal,
  legacy prewarm admission, legacy holder admission, custody fence removal.
- Whole scripts/check --base origin/main: 21 checks green.

Creator explicitly deferred auxiliary Kanban hard bounds/dynamic watches,
resident-demand churn and exhaustive all-family parity/expiry guarantees.
The immutable vector is not a cross-database transaction; 30s reconciliation
is not subsecond upstream truth. No deployment or live CPU result claimed here.
